.alert.alert-light.border
  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Goal of this page
  %p.mb-3 Build and revise a goal tree with spreadsheet-like ease so goals do not feel final before you are ready.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Context
  %p.mb-3
    Draft goals (not started) show a grey left status strip. Once confidence is set, the goal is started and the strip uses on/off-track color.
    A patterned strip means Goal Confidence is stale (Gruuv Health Warning or Needs Attention). Hover the strip (info icon) for why it is that color.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Specifics of this page
  %ul.mb-0
    %li Add a top-level goal, or add a child under any visible goal.
    %li Edits autosave without a full page reload. Paper Trail records changes.
    %li Required to create: title, owner, and type.
    %li Delete/archive from the goal page (link on each row), not from this sheet.
